    "note": "Enrolled text read (HB 4145-B), passed House Feb 25 and Senate Mar 5, 2026. SECTION 1 (section 10, chapter 1, Oregon Laws 2023) moves the date the permit rules apply to firearm transfers from March 15, 2026 to January 1, 2028; SECTION 2 (section 13, chapter 1, Oregon Laws 2023) does the same for large-capacity magazines under ORS 166.355. Both sections strike the old date mid-sentence, so they are described rather than quoted. The LegiScan summary describes earlier versions with more changes (fees, exceptions); the enrolled text carries only these date changes. SECTION 4 declares an emergency."
